```

#### Complete Award Information Update
```bash
curl -X PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/awards/1 \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
  -d '{
    "name": "Giải Nhất Cuộc Thi XYZ",
