## 📁 **File Types & Limits**

| Media Type | Extensions | Max Size | Max Files |
|------------|------------|----------|-----------|
| **Images** | `.jpg, .png, .gif, .webp, .svg` | 5MB each | 5 total |
| **Videos** | `.mp4, .avi, .mov, .webm, .mkv` | 100MB each | 5 total |
| **Audio** | `.mp3, .wav, .ogg, .aac, .flac` | 20MB each | 5 total |

